<p>The <a href=3D"https://developers.arcgis.com/qt/cpp/api-reference/esri-a=
rcgisruntime-geometryengine.html"><code>GeometryEngine</code></a> can be us=
ed to perform geometric operations, measure geometries, evaluate spatial re=
lationships, and project geometries to a new spatial reference, all locally=
 on the client. Each of the geometry engine methods are static, which means=
 they can be called directly on the class (without instantiating an object =
variable).</p>
